        <p>"SAY IT-AND RUN !"</p>
        <p>Mr. McNeill was irresistible. During the discussion on "The Free Churches and the Outside Masses" the Rev. J. Brierley, 8.A., had occasion to speak of the Wesleyan Circuit System. "I am so glad," he said, "that in the mission centres, which are superseding the worn-out—ought I to say it ?" "Say it—and run ." ejaculated Mr. McNeill amid much laughter. .</p>
