        <p>The draw for the first rodnd is as follows :- -.March 28 Timmins Foundry v. Castner Kellner. , 30 W. H. Moore v. Australian Alum. April 1 Co-op Society v. Manure Works No I team. 2 Moore and Co. Ltd. v., Hadfield Bone Works. 4 R. Abel and Sons v. Ha.zlehurst Works. 31 6 High&amp;ld Tannery v. L. &amp; N.-W. Railway Co. 11, 8 Runcorn Docks v. White Lead Works. 12 10 Ship Canal Engineers v. Sprinch. Yard. 19 11 Manure Works No. 2 team v. Salt Union. Wigg Works a bye.</p>
